// `bilan guide` — the complete operator reference, baked into the binary (like
// `machin guide`). Also served at GET /guide. This is THE document an agent should
// read before driving the CLI; llms.txt is the short pointer, this is the full map.

func guide_text(base) (t) {
    t = "# bilan guide — the complete operator reference\n" +
        "\n" +
        "bilan is the deterministic financial ledger + tax radar for professionnels\n" +
        "pluri-actifs (multi-income: salary + micro-BNC/BIC + crypto + trading + rent +\n" +
        "dividends). Humans own the money; their AI assistants (YOU, probably) operate\n" +
        "everything through this CLI. Read this once and you know the full surface.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## The one design rule\n" +
        "There is NO LLM inside bilan — by design, not by omission. Tax and money math\n" +
        "must be deterministic and auditable, so bilan only STORES and COMPUTES; it never\n" +
        "guesses. The intelligence is yours: you parse the messy exports your human hands\n" +
        "you, you explain the JSON, you plan around the numbers. If a CSV doesn't fit a\n" +
        "connector, YOU normalize it (with your own LLM powers) into the generic schema\n" +
        "before importing. The platform never sees a prompt and runs no inference.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Quickstart (local, one binary + one SQLite file)\n" +
        "  export BILAN_DB=~/.bilan.db            # or any path; the file IS the ledger\n" +
        "  bilan demo                              # seed a deterministic pluri-actif ledger (salary+bnc+crypto+rent)\n" +
        "  bilan stats --year 2026                # per-kind totals, net\n" +
        "  bilan tax --year 2026                  # the radar: abattements, PFU, exemption\n" +
        "  (or hand-author: bilan stream add freelance --kind bnc; bilan tx add freelance 2026-03-15 1200 --label \"mission conseil\")\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Concepts\n" +
        "- STREAM: one income/activity line of the foyer (salary, bnc, bic, rent, crypto,\n" +
        "  trading, dividends, other). The kind drives which tax regime math applies.\n" +
        "- TX: one money event (date, signed cents, label). Positive = income, negative =\n" +
        "  expense/loss. Crypto/trading streams expect SIGNED REALIZED P/L per closed\n" +
        "  position (what form 2086 needs), not gross buys/sells.\n" +
        "- TAX RULES: the rate card is DATA in the db (regime, param, value per year), not\n" +
        "  code — a loi de finances change is `bilan rule set`, never a new binary.\n" +
        "- IMPORTS are idempotent: re-importing the same file inserts nothing (ext_id is\n" +
        "  derived from row content). Safe to retry.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Command reference\n" +
        "  stream add <name> --kind <k> [--currency EUR]   new activity stream\n" +
        "  stream list                                     all streams\n" +
        "  tx add <stream> <YYYY-MM-DD> <amount> [--label L --source S --ext-id X]\n" +
        "  tx list [--stream S] [--year Y] [--limit N]     latest first\n" +
        "  import <etoro|revolut|generic> <file|-> --stream S\n" +
        "        file \"-\" reads stdin. generic wants date/amount/label headers (fr\n" +
        "        montant ok). etoro: Close Date + Profit(EUR). revolut: Completed Date.\n" +
        "  stats [--year Y]                                per-kind signed totals + net\n" +
        "  tax [--year Y]                                  the radar (see Tax model)\n" +
        "  rule list [--year Y]                            the rate card\n" +
        "  rule set <year> <regime> <param> <value>        override a rate (rates are DATA)\n" +
        "  move add --kind controle|securite|construction|patrimoine\n" +
        "        --action '...' --pourquoi '...' --impact '...' [--horizon today|week|month]\n" +
        "        propose a move (Brian's format: Action + Pourquoi + Impact). The human\n" +
        "        approves on the dashboard (/app) or `bilan move done <id>`.\n" +
        "  move list [--status proposed|done|dismissed]    the move store\n" +
        "  move done <id> | move dismiss <id>              close a move\n" +
        "  brief [--year Y]                                the morning digest: provision,\n" +
        "        stream momentum (actif/tiede/silencieux), moves en attente. Deterministic —\n" +
        "        the AGENT narrates it; bilan only states what the ledger says.\n" +
        "  brian                                           print the Brian persona — install it\n" +
        "        into any harness (claude-code/pi/opencode) and the agent becomes the copilote\n" +
        "  demo                                            seed a deterministic pluri-actif ledger\n" +
        "        (salary+bnc+crypto+rent) so a cold agent can run the radar in one command (idempotent)\n" +
        "  telemetry                                       aggregate usage + errors across tenants\n" +
        "        (hosted operator only; local mode records none — usage + errors only, NO financial data)\n" +
        "  start                                           the HUMAN first run: what bilan is\n" +
        "        and the exact next command, branching on whether the ledger is empty. Prose,\n" +
        "        not JSON — point your human at it, then go back to help-json yourself.\n" +
        "  guide                                           this document\n" +
        "  feedback <message> [--kind bug|idea|praise]     report a bug/idea (never fails)\n" +
        "  version | update                                release info / self-update\n" +
        "  serve [--port N]                                HTTP JSON API (see below)\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## The human surface (--text)\n" +
        "  stats, tax and brief accept --text: the SAME numbers rendered as French prose\n" +
        "  for the human who owns the money, instead of JSON. Nothing is recomputed — the\n" +
        "  text is a rendering of the JSON core, so the two can never disagree.\n" +
        "    bilan tax --text --year 2026    the radar, line by line, in euros\n" +
        "    bilan brief --text              the morning image\n" +
        "    bilan stats --text              where the money came from\n" +
        "  Use them when your human asks to SEE something. Keep parsing the JSON form\n" +
        "  yourself — --text is display, not a contract, and its layout may change.\n" +
        "  The dashboard (GET /app) is the same image as a page, and shows a first-run\n" +
        "  panel instead of a wall of zeros while the ledger is empty.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## The rate card (seeded for the current year; override per year)\n" +
        "  Sources: BOFiP (bofip.impots.gouv.fr), impots.gouv.fr, legifiscal.fr — see notes.\n" +
        "  micro_bnc:          abattement 34%  ·  social 24.6%   (regime rows micro_bnc)\n" +
        "  micro_bic_services: abattement 50%  ·  social 21.2%\n" +
        "  micro_foncier:      abattement 30%  ·  social 17.2% (on net after abattement)\n" +
        "  capital (crypto/trading): PFU 31.4% on positive net gains\n" +
        "  crypto exemption:   net gains under 305.00 EUR -> not declarable (form 2086)\n" +
        "  dividends:          PFU on the positive sum\n" +
        "  salary:             10% frais abattement (min 509 / max 14555 EUR per member)\n" +
        "                      on gross; net enters the IR base. Source: art. 83 CGI.\n" +
        "  IR barème:          5 progressive brackets on net imposable (0/11/30/41/45%);\n" +
        "                      2025 barème on 2024 income (loi de finances 2025, art. 2,\n" +
        "                      revalorisation +1.8%). Source: BOFiP BOI-IR-LIQ-20-20-30.\n" +
        "  décote:             plafond 889 EUR (célibataire) / 1470 EUR (couple) - 45.25% × IR;\n" +
        "                      applies when IR < ~1965 EUR (single) / 3249 EUR (couple).\n" +
        "                      Source: art. 197 CGI 4°I, BOFiP BOI-IR-LIQ-20-20-30-20250414.\n" +
        "  quotient familial:  ir_bareme parts (default 1; couple = 2, +0.5/child).\n" +
        "                      For fractional parts use demi_parts (couple+1 child = 5).\n" +
        "                      base_parts = 1 (célibataire) or 2 (couple) — the base the\n" +
        "                      plafonnement compares against. Override:\n" +
        "                      bilan rule set 2026 ir_bareme parts 2; base_parts 2\n" +
        "  plafonnement QF:    the tax advantage from demi-parts beyond the base is\n" +
        "                      capped at 1,791 EUR per demi-part (2024 income).\n" +
        "                      Source: art. 197 CGI I.2, BOFiP BOI-IR-LIQ-20-20-20.\n" +
        "  deficits:           BNC/BIC deficits carried forward 6 years (computed from\n" +
        "                      history, not stored). Source: CGI, report en avant.\n" +
        "  déficit foncier:    rent net negative -> up to 10,700 EUR imputed on revenu\n" +
        "                      global (reduces the IR base), excess carried 10y on foncier.\n" +
        "                      Source: art. 156 CGI I.3°, BOFiP BOI-RFPI-BASE-30-20.\n" +
        "  TVA franchise:      franchise en base art. 293 B CGI — services 36,800 EUR,\n" +
        "                      vente 91,900 EUR (2024-2025). The radar checks whether\n" +
        "                      the year's BNC+BIC gross falls under the threshold.\n" +
        "                      Source: BOFiP BOI-TVA-DECLA-40-10-10.\n" +
        "  PAS taux neutre:    prélèvement à la source, taux neutre mensuel (art. 204 H\n" +
        "                      CGI, métropole 2024). The radar projects net salary / 12\n" +
        "                      and applies the grid to estimate the monthly prepayment.\n" +
        "                      Source: BOFiP BOI-BAREME-000037-20240228.\n" +
        "  réductions d'impôt: dons (art. 200 CGI) — 75% to 1,000 EUR (aide aux\n" +
        "                      personnes en difficulté, plafond dérogatoire 2024-2026),\n" +
        "                      then 66% up to 20% of revenu imposable. Record dons as\n" +
        "                      negative txs in a 'dons' stream. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "                      BOI-IR-RICI-250-30, impots.gouv.fr.\n" +
        "  QF special caps:    plafonnement par situation (art. 197 IV/V CGI). Set the\n" +
        "                      'situation' rule on ir_bareme: default (1,791 EUR/demi-\n" +
        "                      part), parent_isole (4,262 EUR total cap), veuf (1,807\n" +
        "                      EUR/demi-part + 2,011 EUR complementary), personne_seule_\n" +
        "                      invalide (3,608 EUR for the single demi-part). Source:\n" +
        "                      service-public.gouv.fr F35120/F35127/F2702, BOFiP\n" +
        "                      BOI-IR-LIQ-20-20-20.\n" +
        "  emploi à domicile:  crédit d'impôt (art. 199 sexdecies CGI) — 50% of dépenses,\n" +
        "                      plafond 12,000 EUR (+1,500 EUR per personne à charge, max\n" +
        "                      15,000 EUR). Record dépenses as negative txs in an\n" +
        "                      'emploi_domicile' stream. This is a CRÉDIT (refundable if\n" +
        "                      it exceeds IR), not a réduction. Source: impots.gouv.fr,\n" +
        "                      BOFiP BOI-IR-RICI-150.\n" +
        "  PINEL:              réduction d'impôt (art. 199 novovicies CGI) — 12% (6y),\n" +
        "                      18% (9y), 21% (12y) on the investment, capped at 300,000\n" +
        "                      EUR. The annual reduction = investment × rate / years.\n" +
        "                      Record the investment as a positive tx in a 'pinel'\n" +
        "                      stream; set the engagement via 'engagement_years' rule.\n" +
        "                      Dispositif ended 31/12/2024 but existing engagements\n" +
        "                      continue. Source: service-public.gouv.fr F31151, BOFiP\n" +
        "                      BOI-IR-RICI-360.\n" +
        "  DENORMANDIE:         réduction d'impôt (art. 199 novovicies IV bis CGI) —\n" +
        "                      same rates as PINEL (12/18/21% by engagement, cap 300,000\n" +
        "                      EUR) but for ANCien with works (≥25% of total cost).\n" +
        "                      Open until 31/12/2027. Record the operation cost as a\n" +
        "                      positive tx in a 'denormandie' stream. Source:\n" +
        "                      service-public.gouv.fr F35011, BOFiP BOI-IR-RICI-360.\n" +
        "  MALRAUX:            réduction d'impôt (art. 199 tervicies CGI) — restoration\n" +
        "                      of immeubles in sites patrimoniaux remarquables. Rate:\n" +
        "                      30% (PSMV approved) or 22% (PVAP approved), cap 400,000\n" +
        "                      EUR of dépenses. NOT subject to plafonnement niches.\n" +
        "                      Record dépenses as positive txs in a 'malraux' stream;\n" +
        "                      set the zone via 'zone' rule (psmv / pvap). Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "                      BOI-IR-RICI-200-30.\n" +
        "  Régime réel foncier: art. 29-31 CGI — if a 'foncier_reel' stream exists,\n" +
        "                      the radar computes net = loyer (positive txs) - charges\n" +
        "                      (negative txs: intérêts d'emprunt, travaux, assurances,\n" +
        "                      taxe foncière) with NO 30% abattement. Combined with the\n" +
        "                      micro-foncier 'rent' stream. The net réel deficit uses the\n" +
        "                      same 10,700 imputation + 10y carry. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "                      BOI-RFPI-BASE-20-80.\n" +
        "  PAS taux personnalisé: art. 204 H CGI — the personalized rate = IR (before\n" +
        "                      reductions/crédits) / revenu imposable, expressed in\n" +
        "                      tenths of a percent. This is a v1 simplification of the\n" +
        "                      BOFiP formula (which weights revenus in the PAS champ vs\n" +
        "                      RNI). It gives a taux moyen d'imposition, not a TMI.\n" +
        "  LMNP micro-BIC:      art. 50 CGI — location meublée non professionnelle.\n" +
        "                      A 'lmnp' stream uses micro-BIC with 50% abattement,\n" +
        "                      threshold 77,700 EUR (2024 income). Deficit carry 6y\n" +
        "                      (like BNC/BIC). Source: BOFiP BOI-BIC-DECLA-10.\n" +
        "  LMNP régime réel:    art. 39 CGI — a 'lmnp_reel' stream computes net = loyer\n" +
        "                      (positive txs) - charges (negative txs: intérêts\n" +
        "                      d'emprunt, taxe foncière, frais de gestion, amortissement)\n" +
        "                      with NO 50% abattement. Deficit carries 6y (NOT 10y like\n" +
        "                      foncier, and NO 10,700 global imputation — that's\n" +
        "                      foncier-only). Source: BOFiP BOI-BIC-BASE-10.\n" +
        "  CENSI-BOUVARD:       art. 199 sexvicies CGI — réduction d'impôt for LMNP in\n" +
        "                      résidences de services (EHPAD, étudiants). 11% of\n" +
        "                      investment, capped at 300,000 EUR, spread over 9 years.\n" +
        "                      Dispositif ended 31/12/2022 but existing engagements\n" +
        "                      continue. Record the investment as a positive tx in a\n" +
        "                      'censi_bouvard' stream. Source: BOFiP BOI-IR-RICI-220-10.\n" +
        "  TVA régime simplifié: art. 302 septies A CGI / L. 162-1 CIBS — eligibility:\n" +
        "                      CA HT between franchise threshold and RSI threshold\n" +
        "                      (services 254,000 / vente 840,000 EUR), AND TVA due <\n" +
        "                      15,000 EUR. The radar reports rsi_eligible. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "                      BOI-BAREME-000036, service-public.gouv.fr F23566.\n" +
        "  TVA collectée /      art. 271 CGI — record TVA facturée aux clients as\n" +
        "  déductible:          positive txs in a 'tva_collectee' stream and TVA payée\n" +
        "                      aux fournisseurs as positive txs in a 'tva_deductible'\n" +
        "                      stream. TVA à payer = collectée - déductible. If\n" +
        "                      negative, crédit de TVA (reportable ou remboursable).\n" +
        "  Frais de garde:      art. 200 quater B CGI — crédit d'impôt for frais de\n" +
        "                      garde d'enfants de moins de 6 ans. 50% of dépenses,\n" +
        "                      capped at 3,500 EUR per child (1,750 in garde alternée).\n" +
        "                      REFUNDABLE (crédit, not réduction). Record dépenses as\n" +
        "                      positive txs in a 'frais_garde' stream. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "                      BOI-IR-RICI-300, service-public.gouv.fr F8.\n" +
        "  Scolarité:           art. 199 quater F CGI — réduction d'impôt forfaitaire\n" +
        "                      for enfants scolarisés: 61 EUR collège, 153 EUR lycée,\n" +
        "                      183 EUR supérieur per child (half in garde alternée).\n" +
        "                      RÉDUCTION (non-refundable). Record the TOTAL forfaitaire\n" +
        "                      reduction as a positive tx in a 'scolarite' stream.\n" +
        "                      Source: BOFiP BOI-IR-RICI-150, service-public.gouv.fr F9.\n" +
        "  Pension alimentaire: art. 156 II.2° CGI — deductible from revenu global\n" +
        "                      (reduces IR base, not IR directly). Capped at 6,794 EUR\n" +
        "                      per child for 2024 income (declaration 2025). Record the\n" +
        "                      pension versée as a positive tx in a 'pension_alimentaire'\n" +
        "                      stream. Source: BOFiP BOI-IR-BASE-20-30-10.\n" +
        "  IR-PME / Madelin:    art. 199 terdecies-0 A CGI — réduction d'impôt for\n" +
        "                      souscriptions au capital de PME. 18% of versements,\n" +
        "                      capped at 50,000 EUR single / 100,000 EUR couple. 25%\n" +
        "                      for ESUS (until 30/09/2026). RÉDUCTION (non-refundable).\n" +
        "                      Subject to plafonnement global des avantages fiscaux\n" +
        "                      (10,000 EUR) — NOT modeled in v1. Record versements as\n" +
        "                      positive txs in an 'ir_pme' stream. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "                      BOI-IR-RICI-290.\n" +
        "  Override any of them: bilan rule set 2027 micro_bnc deduction_pct_tenths 340\n" +
        "  (rates are DECIPERCENT tenths: 340 = 34.0%; all math is integer cents)\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## PER — plan d'épargne retraite (art. 163 quatervicies CGI)\n" +
        "  Record versements as positive txs in a 'per' stream. DEDUCTION from\n" +
        "  revenu global (reduces IR base, like pension alimentaire). 10% of revenus\n" +
        "  professionnels N-1, capped at 8x PASS (35,194 EUR for 2024 income) or 10%\n" +
        "  PASS minimum (4,399 EUR). Simplified: cap at the seeded value (35,194 EUR).\n" +
        "  For TNS the article 154 bis regime (10% bénéfice + 15% between 1-8 PASS) is\n" +
        "  more generous but not modeled separately — record versements in 'per' and\n" +
        "  the radar applies the 163 quatervicies cap. Source: BOFiP BOI-IR-BASE-20-50.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## FCPI/FIP (art. 199 terdecies-0 A VI CGI)\n" +
        "  Record versements as positive txs in a 'fcpi_fip' stream. 18% RÉDUCTION\n" +
        "  (non-refundable), capped at 12,000 EUR single / 24,000 EUR couple. 25% for\n" +
        "  FIP Corse/Outre-Mer (until 2026). Subject to plafonnement global niches.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-IR-RICI-90.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## SOFICA (art. 199 quater E CGI)\n" +
        "  Record versements as positive txs in a 'sofica' stream. 30% RÉDUCTION\n" +
        "  (36% under conditions), capped at 18,000 EUR OR 25% of revenu net global\n" +
        "  (whichever is lower). Subject to plafonnement global with the 18,000 EUR\n" +
        "  cap (not the 10,000 default). Source: BOFiP BOI-IR-RICI-120.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## FOREST — investissement forestier (art. 199 decies HA CGI)\n" +
        "  Record versements as positive txs in a 'forest' stream. 22% RÉDUCTION (18%\n" +
        "  for groupements, 25% for contrats de plantation), capped at 5,700 EUR single\n" +
        "  / 6,250 EUR couple. Subject to plafonnement global niches.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-IR-RICI-50.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Plafonnement global des avantages fiscaux (art. 200-0 A CGI)\n" +
        "  Caps the TOTAL niche tax advantage at 10,000 EUR per year (18,000 EUR when\n" +
        "  SOFICA or outre-mer reductions are present). Applies to: pinel,\n" +
        "  denormandie, censi_bouvard, ir_pme, fcpi_fip, forest, sofica,\n" +
        "  emploi_domicile, frais_garde. Does NOT apply to: dons, scolarite, pension,\n" +
        "  PER (deductions or non-niche). If the sum of niche reductions+credits exceeds\n" +
        "  the cap, the excess is added back to ir_after_credit (the advantage is\n" +
        "  capped). Source: BOFiP BOI-IR-LIQ-20-20-10, service-public.gouv.fr F31179.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## TVA régime normal (art. 287 CGI)\n" +
        "  When CA > RSI upper threshold (254,000 EUR services / 840,000 EUR vente),\n" +
        "  the business must declare TVA via CA3 mensuel (or trimestriel if TVA <\n" +
        "  4,000 EUR/year). The TVA math (collectée - déductible) is the same as RSI;\n" +
        "  only the declaration frequency changes. The radar reports rn_eligible +\n" +
        "  rn_threshold_* in the tva block. Source: BOFiP BOI-TVA-DECLA-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Plus-values immobilières (art. 150 U à 150 VH CGI)\n" +
        "  Record the plus-value BRUTE as a positive tx in a 'plus_value_immo' stream.\n" +
        "  Flat tax: 19% IR + 17.2% prélèvements sociaux = 36.2% total. Abattement for\n" +
        "  durée de détention: IR 6%/year years 6-21, 4% year 22 → 100% after 22y;\n" +
        "  social 1.65%/year years 6-21, 1.6% year 22, 9%/year years 23-30 → 100%\n" +
        "  after 30y. Set detention years: bilan rule set 2026 plus_value_immo\n" +
        "  detention_years 10. Exonération if cession price ≤ 15,000 EUR (don't record).\n" +
        "  New plus_values.immo JSON block + totals.pv_immo_cents.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-RFPI-PVI-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## IFI — impôt sur la fortune immobilière (art. 977 CGI)\n" +
        "  Record the net taxable patrimoine value as a positive tx in an\n" +
        "  'ifi_patrimoine' stream. Barème progressif: 0-800k: 0%, 800k-1.3M: 0.5%,\n" +
        "  1.3M-2.57M: 0.7%, 2.57M-5M: 1%, 5M-10M: 1.25%, >10M: 1.5%. Seuil\n" +
        "  déclenchement: 1.3M (but taxation starts at 800k). Décote for 1.3M-1.4M:\n" +
        "  17,500 - 1.25% × P. New ifi JSON block + totals.ifi_cents.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-PAT-ISF-40.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Heures supplémentaires (art. 81 quater CGI)\n" +
        "  Record the net imposable amount of heures supplémentaires as a positive\n" +
        "  tx in a 'heures_sup' stream. Exonération d'IR up to 7,500 EUR/year (cap\n" +
        "  overridable: bilan rule set 2026 heures_sup cap_cents <cents>). The radar\n" +
        "  subtracts the exempt amount (capped) from net_salary before ir_base.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-RSA-CHAMP-20-50-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## CFE — cotisation foncière des entreprises (art. 1647 D CGI)\n" +
        "  The radar estimates the CFE cotisation minimum from the BNC + BIC gross\n" +
        "  CA. Base minimum by CA bracket (midpoint of the legal range, overridable\n" +
        "  via cfe.bracket*_base_cents). Communal rate default 20% (overridable via\n" +
        "  bilan rule set 2026 cfe rate_pct_tenths <val>). Exonération if CA ≤ 5,000\n" +
        "  EUR. CFE = base × rate / 1000. New cfe JSON block + totals.cfe_cents.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-IF-CFE-20-20-40-10.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## CVAE — cotisation sur la valeur ajoutée des entreprises (art. 1586 ter CGI)\n" +
        "  Progressive effective rate based on CA: 0% < 500k, 0.25% at 3M, 0.7% at\n" +
        "  10M, 0.75% > 50M. Assujettie if CA > 152,500 EUR but franchise if CA ≤\n" +
        "  500,000 EUR. VA approximated as 45% of CA (simplified). 2024 reduction\n" +
        "  25% (art. 79 LF 2024). Being phased out (suppression 2027). New cvae JSON\n" +
        "  block + totals.cvae_cents. Source: BOFiP BOI-CVAE-LIQ-10.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Plus-values mobilières (art. 200 A CGI)\n" +
        "  PFU flat tax 12.8% IR + 17.2% social = 30% by default. Option for barème\n" +
        "  progressif (case 2OP) — global, applies to all capitaux mobiliers. For\n" +
        "  titres acquired before 2018 with the barème option, abattement durée de\n" +
        "  détention: 50% (2-8y), 65% (>8y). Set detention: bilan rule set 2026 pvm\n" +
        "  detention_years <years>. The radar computes BOTH PFU and barème option and\n" +
        "  reports the lower (optimal field). New pvm JSON block + totals.pvm_cents.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-RPPM-PVMC-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Surtaxe sur plus-values immobilières élevées (art. 1609 nonies G CGI)\n" +
        "  Progressive surtaxe on PV nette imposable > 50,000 EUR. Applies to\n" +
        "  immeubles bâtis only (not terrains à bâtir). Brackets: 2% (50k-60k),\n" +
        "  3% (60k-100k), 4% (100k-150k), 5% (150k-200k), 6% (200k-250k), 6%\n" +
        "  (> 250k). Computed on pv_ir_base (net imposable after abattement).\n" +
        "  New plus_values.immo.surtaxe_cents + totals.pv_immo_surtaxe_cents.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-RFPI-TPVIE-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Taxe forfaitaire sur métaux précieux et objets d'art (art. 150 VI/VK CGI)\n" +
        "  Cessions or exports outside EU of: métaux précieux (11%), bijoux/objets\n" +
        "  d'art/collection/antiquité (6%). The radar computes the taxe forfaitaire\n" +
        "  on the gross cession price (not the plus-value). Record cessions in a\n" +
        "  'metaux' or 'objets_art' stream. Option art. 150 VL for régime plus-values\n" +
        "  mobilières (not modeled — the radar uses the forfaitaire by default).\n" +
        "  New metaux_precieux JSON block + totals.metaux_precieux_cents. New stream\n" +
        "  kinds: metaux, objets_art. Source: BOFiP BOI-RPPM-PVMC-30.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Monuments historiques (art. 156 I-3° et II-1° ter CGI)\n" +
        "  Déduction des charges foncières du revenu global — 100% if open to\n" +
        "  public, 50% otherwise. No cap (hors plafonnement global des niches).\n" +
        "  15-year conservation engagement. Record charges as negative txs in a\n" +
        "  'monument_historique' stream. Set openness: bilan rule set 2026\n" +
        "  monuments_historiques ouvert_public 1. New monuments_historiques JSON\n" +
        "  block + ir.mh_deduction_cents. Source: BOFiP BOI-IR-BASE-20-40.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Démembrement — barème de l'usufruit viager (art. 669 CGI)\n" +
        "  Valeur de l'usufruit selon l'âge de l'usufruitier au jour de l'acte.\n" +
        "  La nue-propriété vaut le complément à 100%. S'applique aux DMTG,\n" +
        "  droits d'enregistrement, et IFI. Set age: bilan rule set 2026\n" +
        "  demembrement usufruitier_age <years>. The radar reports the valuation\n" +
        "  (informational — for DMTG/IFI planning). New demembrement JSON block.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-ENR-DMTG-10-20-20-10.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## PER TNS — article 154 bis CGI\n" +
        "  Plafond de déduction des cotisations retraite du bénéfice catégoriel\n" +
        "  (BIC/BNC). 10% du bénéfice (limité à 8 PASS) + 15% de la fraction du\n" +
        "  bénéfice comprise entre 1 et 8 PASS. Plancher 10% du PASS. The radar\n" +
        "  uses 154 bis when there is TNS income (net_bnc + net_bic > 0), else\n" +
        "  163 quatervicies (10% revenus N-1, cap 8 PASS). A single cotisation\n" +
        "  can't be deducted on both. New ir fields: per_regime,\n" +
        "  per_tns_plafond_cents, per_163_quatervicies_cap_cents. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "  BOI-IR-BASE-20-50.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Abattement départ retraite dirigeants — article 150-0 D ter CGI\n" +
        "  Abattement fixe de 500000 EUR sur les gains nets de cession de titres\n" +
        "  de PME par un dirigeant partant à la retraite. Conditions: cession de\n" +
        "  l'intégralité des titres (ou >50% droits de vote), détention ≥ 1 an,\n" +
        "  fonctions de direction continues 5 ans avant cession, détention ≥ 25%\n" +
        "  droits de vote/bénéfices. Prélèvements sociaux dus sur la PV avant\n" +
        "  abattement (social on full gain, IR on gain after abattement). Set:\n" +
        "  bilan rule set 2026 pvm_depart_retraite eligible 1. New pvm fields:\n" +
        "  depart_retraite_eligible, depart_retraite_abattement_cents,\n" +
        "  ir_base_after_abattement_cents. Source: BOFiP BOI-RPPM-PVBMI-20-40-10.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## LMNP amortissement — article 39 C CGI\n" +
        "  Amortissement linéaire par composants for LMNP régime réel. The radar\n" +
        "  computes the annual dotation based on property value and component\n" +
        "  durations (gros œuvre 50y, toiture 30y, réseaux 25y, agencements 12y,\n" +
        "  mobilier 7y). Terrain is never amortissable (default 15% of property\n" +
        "  value). Plafonnement art. 39 C: the dotation can't exceed the loyer net\n" +
        "  of other charges (can't create a deficit); the excess is reportable\n" +
        "  (ARD). Set: bilan rule set 2026 lmnp_amortissement property_value_cents\n" +
        "  <val> and mobilier_value_cents <val>. New lmnp_amortissement JSON block.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-BIC-AMT-10-40.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Option art. 150 VL — régime plus-values for métaux/objets d'art\n" +
        "  The seller of métaux précieux or objets d'art can opt for the régime\n" +
        "  des plus-values (art. 150 UA) instead of the taxe forfaitaire (art. 150\n" +
        "  VI). PV = prix cession - prix acquisition. Abattement 5% per year of\n" +
        "  detention beyond year 2, exonération after 22 years. Tax: 19% IR +\n" +
        "  17.2% social on the net PV after abattement. The radar computes both and\n" +
        "  reports the lower. Set: bilan rule set 2026 metaux_precieux\n" +
        "  option_150vl_eligible 1, option_150vl_acquisition_cents <price>,\n" +
        "  option_150vl_detention_years <years>. New metaux_precieux fields:\n" +
        "  option_150vl_*, optimal, forfaitaire_total_cents. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "  BOI-RPPM-PVBMC-20-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Quasi-usufruit — article 774 bis CGI (LF 2024)\n" +
        "  Dettes de restitution on sums of money whose deceased reserved the\n" +
        "  usufruit are NOT deductible from the actif successoral, with\n" +
        "  exceptions: (1) dettes on cession price of a bien (if not principally\n" +
        "  tax-motivated), (2) usufruits légaux art. 757/1094-1 C. civ.\n" +
        "  (conjoint survivant). The radar computes the deductible portion.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 quasi_usufruit creance_restitution_cents\n" +
        "  <val> + exception flags. New quasi_usufruit JSON block. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "  BOI-ENR-DMTG-10-40-20-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Démembrement temporaire — article 669 II + art. 13-5 1° CGI\n" +
        "  Usufruit temporaire = 23% per 10-year period (pro rata), capped at\n" +
        "  the viager value for the same usufruitier age (art. 669 I). Article\n" +
        "  13-5 1°: the cession price of a temporary usufruit on a bien\n" +
        "  producteur de revenus is taxed as revenu catégoriel (foncier, BIC),\n" +
        "  not as plus-value. The radar reports the fiscal valuation\n" +
        "  (informational). Set: bilan rule set 2026 demembrement_temporaire\n" +
        "  duree_years <val> + bien_valeur_cents <val> + usufruitier_age <val>.\n" +
        "  New demembrement_temporaire JSON block. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "  BOI-RPPM-PVMC-20-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## LMNP ARD carry-forward — article 39 C II.2 CGI\n" +
        "  Amortissements réputés différés (ARD) are the fraction of the\n" +
        "  dotation that exceeded the plafond in prior years, reportable sans\n" +
        "  limite de durée. The radar walks prior years (10y lookback) to\n" +
        "  compute the ARD stock: each year, if the loyer net was positive, the\n" +
        "  dotation was capped and the excess was added to the stock; if the\n" +
        "  loyer net was negative, the full dotation was deferred. The stock is\n" +
        "  consumed when a future year's plafond exceeds the dotation brute. New\n" +
        "  lmnp_amortissement fields: ard_stock_prior_cents, ard_consumed_cents,\n" +
        "  ard_stock_after_cents. Source: BOFiP BOI-BIC-AMT-20-40-10.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## PAS taux individualisé — article 204 M CGI (LF 2024)\n" +
        "  For couples mariés/PACS soumis à imposition commune, the taux\n" +
        "  individualisé becomes the default (instead of taux du foyer) from 1er\n" +
        "  septembre 2025. The conjoint with the lowest revenus personnels gets\n" +
        "  taux1 = IR1 / (rev_perso1 + ½ rev_communs), where IR1 is computed on\n" +
        "  rev_perso1 + ½ rev_communs with ½ parts. The other conjoint gets taux2\n" +
        "  = (IR_foyer - IR1 - IR_communs) / rev_perso2. Set: bilan rule set 2026\n" +
        "  pas_individualise conjoint1_revenu_perso_cents <val> +\n" +
        "  conjoint2_revenu_perso_cents <val> + revenus_communs_cents <val>. New\n" +
        "  pas_individualise JSON block. Source: BOFiP BOI-IR-PAS-20-20-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## DMTG — droits de mutation à titre gratuit (art. 777 CGI)\n" +
        "  Barème by degree of parenté. Ligne directe: 5/10/15/20/30/40/45%\n" +
        "  after 100000 EUR abattement. Conjoint/PACS: exonération totale\n" +
        "  (successions depuis 22/08/2007). Frères-sœurs: 35% < 24430, 45% >\n" +
        "  after 15932 EUR abattement. 4e degré: 55%. Tiers: 60% after 1594 EUR\n" +
        "  abattement. Art. 774 bis II: DMTG on non-deductible quasi-usufruit\n" +
        "  créance, calculated by degree of parenté between nu-propriétaire and\n" +
        "  usufruitier. Set: bilan rule set 2026 dmtg actif_taxable_cents <val> +\n" +
        "  degre_parente <ligne_directe|conjoint|frere_soeur|quatrieme_degre|tiers>.\n" +
        "  New dmtg JSON block. Source: BOFiP BOI-ENR-DMTG-20-30.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Assurance-vie succession — articles 990 I + 757 B CGI\n" +
        "  Two regimes by date of versement. Art. 990 I (primes versées avant\n" +
        "  70 ans): prélèvement per bénéficiaire, abattement fixe 152500 EUR,\n" +
        "  puis 20% on fraction ≤ 700000 EUR, 31.25% >. Independent of degree\n" +
        "  of parenté (except exonérations: conjoint, PACS, frère-sœur under\n" +
        "  conditions). Art. 757 B (primes versées après 70 ans): primes enter\n" +
        "  the succession and follow the DMTG barème (art. 777), after a global\n" +
        "  abattement of 30500 EUR (shared among all beneficiaries). Set: bilan\n" +
        "  rule set 2026 assurance_vie capital_avant_70_cents <val> +\n" +
        "  primes_apres_70_cents <val>. New assurance_vie JSON block. Source:\n" +
        "  BOFiP BOI-ENR-ASSUR-10/20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## PER TNS cumul — articles 154 bis + 163 quatervicies CGI\n" +
        "  A TNS can cumulate both ceilings for the same year (if no prior\n" +
        "  versements): 154 bis (10% bénéfice N + 15% 1-8 PASS, plancher 10%\n" +
        "  PASS N) + 163 quatervicies (10% revenus N-1, plancher 10% PASS\n" +
        "  N-1). The same cotisation can't be deducted twice. The radar computes\n" +
        "  the combined ceiling. Set: bilan rule set 2026 per_cumul\n" +
        "  revenus_n1_cents <val>. New per_cumul JSON block. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "  BOI-RPPM-RCM-20-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Assurance-vie démembrement clause bénéficiaire — art. 669 prorata\n" +
        "  When the clause is démembrée (usufruitier + nus-propriétaires), the\n" +
        "  abattement 990 I (152500) is réparti between usufruitier and NP\n" +
        "  according to the art. 669 barème by age of usufruitier. The\n" +
        "  usufruitier (conjoint) is exoneré, so only the NP share is taxed.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 assurance_vie demembrement_eligible 1 +\n" +
        "  demembrement_usufruitier_age <val> + demembrement_np_count <val>.\n" +
        "  New assurance_vie.demembrement JSON sub-block. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "  BOI-TCAS-AUT-60 §310.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## PV professionnelles de cession — art. 151 septies + 151 septies B\n" +
        "  Article 151 septies: exonération totale des PV de cession pour\n" +
        "  petites entreprises (activité ≥ 5 ans, recettes < seuils: commerce\n" +
        "  250000, artisanat 90000, libéral/agricole 350000 EUR). Article 151\n" +
        "  septies B: abattement de 10% par année de détention au-delà de la\n" +
        "  5ème année, sur biens immobiliers bâtis/non bâtis affectés à\n" +
        "  l'exploitation (plafond 10 ans = exonération totale après 15 ans).\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 pv_pro plus_value_cents <val> +\n" +
        "  duree_activite_years <val> + recettes_cents <val> + activite_type\n" +
        "  <commerce|artisanat|liberal|agricole>. New pv_pro JSON block.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-BIC-PVMV-40-10-10/20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## DMTG donation — art. 777 CGI (Tableau II conjoint)\n" +
        "  Same barème as succession for ligne directe/frère-sœur/4e degré/\n" +
        "  tiers, but conjoint/PACS follows Tableau II (NOT exoneré for\n" +
        "  donations, abattement 80724 EUR). Art. 789 bis: abattement 500000\n" +
        "  EUR sur donation de fonds de commerce/entreprise individuelle.\n" +
        "  Abattements renouvelables tous les 15 ans (art. 779). Set: bilan\n" +
        "  rule set 2026 dmtg_donation actif_taxable_cents <val> +\n" +
        "  degre_parente <ligne_directe|conjoint|frere_soeur|quatrieme_degre|tiers>\n" +
        "  + abattement_789_bis_eligible <0|1>. New dmtg_donation JSON block.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-ENR-DMTG-20-30.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## PV sur valeurs mobilières — art. 150-0 A + 150-0 D CGI\n" +
        "  Article 150-0 A: gain net = prix cession - prix acquisition.\n" +
        "  Article 150-0 D 1 ter: abattement 50% >2 ans, 65% >8 ans (sociétés\n" +
        "  non-PME). Article 150-0 D 1 quater: abattement 50% >1 an, 75% >5\n" +
        "  ans (PME). Set: bilan rule set 2026 pv_mobiliere\n" +
        "  prix_acquisition_cents <val> + prix_cession_cents <val> +\n" +
        "  duree_detention_years <val> + is_pme <0|1>. New pv_mobiliere JSON\n" +
        "  block. Source: BOFiP BOI-RPPM-PVMC-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## DMTG handicap — art. 779 II CGI\n" +
        "  Abattement 159325 EUR pour héritier/légataire/donataire handicapé\n" +
        "  (incapable de travailler dans des conditions normales de rentabilité).\n" +
        "  Cumulable avec les autres abattements. Set: bilan rule set 2026 dmtg\n" +
        "  handicap_eligible 1. New dmtg_handicap JSON block. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "  BOI-ENR-DMTG-10-50-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Pacte Dutreil — art. 787 B CGI\n" +
        "  Abattement 75% sur la valeur de l'entreprise transmise (engagement\n" +
        "  collectif 2y + individuel 4y). Réduction 50% sur les droits restants\n" +
        "  si donateur < 70 ans et donation en pleine propriété (art. 790).\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 dmtg dutreil_eligible 1 +\n" +
        "  dutreil_donateur_age <val> + dutreil_pleine_propriete 1. New\n" +
        "  dmtg_dutreil JSON block. Source: BOFiP BOI-ENR-DMTG-20-30-50.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Donation démembrement — art. 669 CGI\n" +
        "  Le donateur transmet la nue-propriété et conserve l'usufruit. La\n" +
        "  base taxable est la valeur de la nue-propriété, déterminée par le\n" +
        "  barème art. 669 selon l'âge du donateur (<21: NP 10%, 21-30: 20%,\n" +
        "  31-40: 30%, 41-50: 40%, 51-60: 50%, 61-70: 60%, 71-80: 70%, 81-90:\n" +
        "  80%, 91+: 90%). Au décès de l'usufruitier, la pleine propriété se\n" +
        "  reconstitute sans DMTG supplémentaire (art. 1133). Set: bilan rule\n" +
        "  set 2026 dmtg_donation demembrement_eligible 1 +\n" +
        "  demembrement_donateur_age <val>. New dmtg_donation_demembrement\n" +
        "  JSON block. Source: BOFiP BOI-ENR-DMTG-10-30.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## PV pro exonération partielle — art. 151 septies II 2° CGI\n" +
        "  Entre le seuil d'exonération totale et le seuil d'exonération\n" +
        "  partielle, un abattement dégressif s'applique: taux = (seuil_partiel\n" +
        "  - recettes) / (seuil_partiel - seuil_total). Commerce: 250k-350k.\n" +
        "  Artisanat/libéral: 90k-126k. Agricole: 350k-450k. Le pv_pro JSON\n" +
        "  block expose maintenant exoneration_partielle et le taux dégressif.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-BIC-PVMV-40-10-10-30.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Donation temporaire d'usufruit — art. 669 II CGI\n" +
        "  Le donateur transmet l'usufruit temporaire (durée fixe). Valeur\n" +
        "  usufruit = 23% par tranche de 10 ans entamée (1-10y: 23%, 11-20y:\n" +
        "  46%, 21-30y: 69%, 31-40y: 92%), plafonné au viager (art. 669 I by\n" +
        "  âge donateur). DMTG on usufruit value. Set: bilan rule set 2026\n" +
        "  dmtg_donation usufruit_temporaire_eligible 1 +\n" +
        "  usufruit_temporaire_duree_years <val> +\n" +
        "  usufruit_temporaire_donateur_age <val>. New\n" +
        "  dmtg_donation_usufruit_temporaire JSON block. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "  BOI-ENR-DMTG-10-30.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## PV mobilière report d'imposition — art. 150-0 D bis CGI\n" +
        "  Cession de titres qualifiés (≥10% droits détenus 8y),\n" +
        "  réinvestissement ≥50% de la plus-value nette dans souscription PME\n" +
        "  dans 24 mois → report d'imposition (imposition différée). Le\n" +
        "  report suspend l'imposition; aucun abattement durée détention ne\n" +
        "  s'applique pendant le report. Le pv_mobiliere JSON block expose\n" +
        "  maintenant report.eligible, report.reinvesti_pct, report.gain_reporte\n" +
        "  et report.gain_imposable. Set: bilan rule set 2026 pv_mobiliere\n" +
        "  report_eligible 1 + report_reinvesti_pct <val>. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "  BOI-RPPM-PVBMI-30-10-60-10.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## IFI démembrement — art. 968 CGI\n" +
        "  Règle par défaut: l'usufruitier déclare la pleine propriété (le\n" +
        "  nu-propriétaire ne déclare rien). Exception: si le démembrement\n" +
        "  résulte de dispositions spécifiques (art. 757/767 Cciv, vente avec\n" +
        "  réserve d'usufruit, don/legs à l'État), alors répartition par les\n" +
        "  proportions de l'article 669. Le ifi JSON block expose maintenant\n" +
        "  demembrement.usufruit_pct, demembrement.nue_propriete_pct,\n" +
        "  demembrement.usufruit_value, demembrement.nue_propriete_value. Set:\n" +
        "  bilan rule set 2026 ifi demembrement_eligible 1 +\n" +
        "  demembrement_usufruitier_age <val> + demembrement_exception <0|1> +\n" +
        "  demembrement_bien_valeur_cents <val>. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "  BOI-PAT-IFI-20-20-30-10.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## IFI plafonnement 75% — art. 979 CGI (bouclier fiscal)\n" +
        "  IFI + impôts sur les revenus N-1 limités à 75% des revenus\n" +
        "  mondiaux nets N-1. Réduction = MAX(0, (IFI net + impôts revenus\n" +
        "  N-1) - 75% × revenus mondiaux nets N-1). Le ifi JSON block expose\n" +
        "  maintenant plafonnement.eligible, plafonnement.reduction_cents,\n" +
        "  plafonnement.ifi_apres_plafonnement_cents. Set: bilan rule set 2026\n" +
        "  ifi plafonnement_eligible 1 + plafonnement_revenus_n1_cents <val>\n" +
        "  + plafonnement_impots_n1_cents <val>. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "  BOI-PAT-IFI-40-30-10.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## IFI réduction dons — art. 978 CGI\n" +
        "  75% des dons aux organismes d'intérêt général, plafond 50000 EUR\n" +
        "  par redevable et par an. Appliquée AVANT le plafonnement (art.\n" +
        "  979). Le ifi JSON block expose maintenant dons.eligible,\n" +
        "  dons.reduction_cents, dons.ifi_avant_dons_cents. Set: bilan rule\n" +
        "  set 2026 ifi dons_eligible 1 + dons_montant_cents <val>. Source:\n" +
        "  BOFiP BOI-PAT-IFI-40-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## DMTG abattement renouvelable 15 ans — art. 779 CGI\n" +
        "  Les abattements (ligne directe 100000, conjoint 80724, etc.)\n" +
        "  sont renouvelables tous les 15 ans. Pour une donation dans les\n" +
        "  15 ans suivant une donation précédente, l'abattement est réduit\n" +
        "  du montant déjà utilisé. Le dmtg_donation JSON block expose\n" +
        "  maintenant abattement_renouvellement.deja_utilise_cents,\n" +
        "  abattement_renouvellement.derniere_donation_year,\n" +
        "  abattement_renouvellement.abattement_reduit_cents,\n" +
        "  abattement_renouvellement.renewed. Set: bilan rule set 2026\n" +
        "  dmtg_donation abattement_deja_utilise_cents <val> +\n" +
        "  derniere_donation_year <val>. Source: BOFiP BOI-ENR-DMTG-10-30-10.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Crédit d'impôt adaptation du logement — art. 200 quater A CGI\n" +
        "  25% des dépenses d'adaptation du logement à la perte d'autonomie\n" +
        "  ou au handicap, plafond 5000 EUR (célibataire) / 10000 EUR\n" +
        "  (couple) sur 5 ans. CRÉDIT REMBOURSABLE (refundable si > IR).\n" +
        "  Dépenses enregistrées comme tx positifs dans un stream\n" +
        "  'adaptation_logement'. Le radar expose\n" +
        "  ir.adaptation_logement_credit_cents +\n" +
        "  reductions.adaptation_logement.credit_cents. Set: bilan rule\n" +
        "  set 2026 adaptation_logement situation <single|couple>. Source:\n" +
        "  BOFiP BOI-IR-RICI-290, service-public.gouv.fr F10752.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Crédit d'impôt borne de recharge VE — art. 200 quater C CGI\n" +
        "  75% des dépenses d'installation d'une borne de recharge\n" +
        "  pilotable, plafond 500 EUR par système. 2025 uniquement\n" +
        "  (supprimé pour dépenses payées à compter du 01/01/2026).\n" +
        "  CRÉDIT REMBOURSABLE. Dépenses enregistrées comme tx positifs\n" +
        "  dans un stream 'borne_recharge'. Le radar expose\n" +
        "  ir.borne_recharge_credit_cents +\n" +
        "  reductions.borne_recharge.credit_cents. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "  BOI-IR-RICI-360.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Taxe sur les salaires — art. 231 CGI\n" +
        "  Taxe progressive sur les employeurs NON assujettis à la TVA\n" +
        "  (ou TVA < 90% du CA). Barème 2025: 4.25% ≤9147 EUR, 8.5%\n" +
        "  9147-18258 EUR, 13.6% >18258 EUR. Décote art. 1679: si taxe\n" +
        "  1200-2040 EUR, décote = 3/4 × (2040 - taxe). Abattement\n" +
        "  associations art. 1679 A: 24041 EUR (2025). Le radar expose\n" +
        "  taxe_salaires.salaires_bruts_cents, taxe_salaires.tax_cents,\n" +
        "  taxe_salaires.abattement_cents, taxe_salaires.decote_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 taxe_salaires salaires_bruts_cents\n" +
        "  <val> + abattement_eligible <0|1>. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "  BOI-RPPM-TXS-10, legisocial.fr.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Taxe d'apprentissage — art. 1599 CGI\n" +
        "  0.68% de la masse salariale (0.59% part principale + 0.09%\n" +
        "  solde). Alsace-Moselle taux réduit 0.44% (0.36% + 0.08%).\n" +
        "  Exonération si base ≤ 6×SMIC annuel (≈ 139000 EUR en 2025).\n" +
        "  Le radar expose taxe_apprentissage.masse_salariale_cents,\n" +
        "  taxe_apprentissage.part_principale_cents,\n" +
        "  taxe_apprentissage.solde_cents, taxe_apprentissage.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 taxe_apprentissage\n" +
        "  masse_salariale_cents <val> + region\n" +
        "  <metropole|alsace_moselle>. Source: BOFiP BOI-TPA-TA-10,\n" +
        "  economie.gouv.fr.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Contribution supplémentaire à l'apprentissage (CSA)\n" +
        "  Pour entreprises ≥250 salariés avec <5% d'alternants. Taux\n" +
        "  progressif par ratio d'alternants: <1% → 0.4% (0.6% si\n" +
        "  ≥2000 salariés), 1-2% → 0.2%, 2-3% → 0.1%, 3-5% → 0.05%,\n" +
        "  ≥5% → exonéré. Le radar expose taxe_apprentissage.csa.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 taxe_apprentissage csa_eligible 1\n" +
        "  + csa_effectif_moyen <val> + csa_alternants_pct_tenths <val>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-TPA-CSA-10, urssaf.fr.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Crédit d'impôt recherche (CIR) — art. 244 quater B CGI\n" +
        "  30% des dépenses de recherche ≤ 100M EUR, 5% au-delà. DOM:\n" +
        "  50% ≤ 100M, 5% au-delà. Remboursable pour JEI (Jeune Entreprise\n" +
        "  Innovante), sinon imputable sur l'IS/IR. Le radar expose\n" +
        "  cir.depenses_cents, cir.credit_cents, cir.jei_eligible.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 cir depenses_cents <val>\n" +
        "  + dom_eligible <0|1> + jei_eligible <0|1>. Source: BOFiP\n" +
        "  BOI-BIC-RICI-10-10-30, entreprises.gouv.fr.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Crédit d'impôt innovation (CII) — art. 244 quater B bis CGI\n" +
        "  20% des dépenses d'innovation (60% DOM), plafond 400000 EUR/an\n" +
        "  pour PME. Le radar expose cir.cii.credit_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 cir cii_depenses_cents <val>\n" +
        "  + cii_dom_eligible <0|1>. Source: BOFiP BOI-BIC-RICI-10-15-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Plafonnement de la CET — art. 1647 B sexies CGI\n" +
        "  Si CFE + CVAE > taux × valeur ajoutée, dégrèvement =\n" +
        "  CET - plafond. Taux 1.438% (2025), 1.531% (2026/2027).\n" +
        "  Floor: CET après dégrèvement ≥ cotisation minimum CFE\n" +
        "  (art. 1647 D). Le radar expose cet_plafonnement.cet_cents,\n" +
        "  cet_plafonnement.plafond_cents,\n" +
        "  cet_plafonnement.degrevement_cents,\n" +
        "  cet_plafonnement.cet_after_degrevement_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 cet_plafonnement\n" +
        "  valeur_ajoutee_cents <val> + cfe_minimum_cents <val>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-IF-CFE-40-30-20-30.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Taxe annuelle sur les bureaux (TSB) — art. 231 ter + 1599 quater C\n" +
        "  Taxe par m² sur bureaux, locaux commerciaux, stockage,\n" +
        "  stationnement en Île-de-France (4 circonscriptions) et\n" +
        "  PACA. Tarifs 2025 IDF: bureaux 25.77€ (c1) / 21.70€ (c2) /\n" +
        "  11.87€ (c3) / 5.74€ (c4). PACA: bureaux 0.99€/m². Exonérations:\n" +
        "  bureaux <100m², commercial <2500m², stockage <5000m²,\n" +
        "  stationnement <500m². TSS additionnelle sur stationnement\n" +
        "  ≥500m² en IDF. Le radar expose tsb.tax_cents, tsb.tss.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 tsb surface_m2 <val>\n" +
        "  + category <bureaux|commercial|stockage|stationnement>\n" +
        "  + region <idf|paca> + circonscription <1-4>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-IF-TF-10, service-public.gouv.fr.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Contribution sur les revenus locatifs (CRL) — art. 234 nonies CGI\n" +
        "  2.5% sur loyers perçus par personnes morales sur immeubles\n" +
        "  achevés ≥15 ans. Exonération: loyer <1830 EUR/local/an,\n" +
        "  ou soumis à TVA. Le radar expose crl.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 crl loyers_cents <val>\n" +
        "  + tva_assujettie <0|1>. Source: BOFiP BOI-RFPI-CTRL-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Versement mobilité (VM) — art. L52-53 code des transports\n" +
        "  Contribution patronale pour employeurs ≥11 salariés dans\n" +
        "  zone AOM. Taux configurable (IDF 1.5-2.95%, VMRR 0.15%\n" +
        "  max hors IDF 2025). Base = rémunérations soumises à\n" +
        "  cotisations sociales. Le radar expose\n" +
        "  versement_mobilite.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 versement_mobilite\n" +
        "  effectif_moyen <val> + remunerations_cents <val>\n" +
        "  + taux_pct_hundredths <val>. Source: urssaf.fr.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Retenue à la source non-résidents (PASNR) — art. 182 A CGI\n" +
        "  Barème 2025: 0% ≤17122, 12% 17122-49667, 20% >49667.\n" +
        "  DOM: 0%/8%/14.4%. Abattement 10% frais professionnels.\n" +
        "  Le radar expose pasnr.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 pasnr revenus_bruts_cents <val>\n" +
        "  + dom_eligible <0|1>. Source: BOFiP BOI-IR-DOMIC-10-20-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Prélèvement de solidarité — art. 119 bis 2 CGI\n" +
        "  25% sur dividendes versés à non-résidents. 12.8% IR +\n" +
        "  17.2% social = 30% PFU sur intérêts. Le radar expose\n" +
        "  prelevement_solidarite.total_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 prelevement_solidarite\n" +
        "  dividendes_cents <val> + interets_cents <val>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-IR-DOMIC-10-20-50.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Taxes sur cession de terrains nus devenus constructibles\n" +
        "  — art. 1529 + 1605 nonies CGI\n" +
        "  Art. 1529: taxe forfaitaire 10% sur PV (prix cession -\n" +
        "  prix acquisition actualisé). Forfaitaire 2/3 prix si pas\n" +
        "  de référence. Art. 1605 nonies: taxe 5% si ratio\n" +
        "  cession/acquisition 10-30, 10% au-delà. Abattement 1/10\n" +
        "  par an au-delà de la 8e année (exonération 18 ans).\n" +
        "  Exonération: prix cession <15000 EUR, ratio <10.\n" +
        "  Le radar expose terrains_constructibles.art_1529.tax_cents,\n" +
        "  terrains_constructibles.art_1605_nonies.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 terrains_constructibles\n" +
        "  prix_cession_cents <val> + prix_acquisition_cents <val>\n" +
        "  + annees_apres_constructible <val>\n" +
        "  + forfaitaire_sans_reference <0|1>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-RFPI-TDC-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Taxe sur les conventions d'assurances (TSCA) — art. 1001 CGI\n" +
        "  Taxe sur primes d'assurance. Incendie 30% (general),\n" +
        "  24% caisses départementales, 7% agricole, 12%\n" +
        "  professionnel; pertes d'exploitation 33%; automobile\n" +
        "  33%; toutes autres assurances 9%; assurance-vie 3.5%.\n" +
        "  Le radar expose tsca.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 tsca prime_cents <val>\n" +
        "  + category <incendie_general|incendie_caisses_departementales\n" +
        "  |incendie_agricole|incendie_professionnel|pertes_exploitation\n" +
        "  |automobile|assurance_vie|autres>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-TCAS-ASSUR-30.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Taxe de solidarité transport aérien (TTAP) — art. L. 422-20 CIBS\n" +
        "  Ex-art. 302 bis K CGI. Taxe par passager selon destination\n" +
        "  et classe: <1000km 120/60/10 EUR (business/economy/autre),\n" +
        "  1000-2200km 360/180/30, >2200km 1200/400/60. Fret:\n" +
        "  50 EUR/tonne. Le radar expose\n" +
        "  ttap_solidarite.total_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 ttap_solidarite\n" +
        "  passagers_cents <val> + classe <business|economy|autre>\n" +
        "  + distance <courte|moyenne|longue> + fret_tonnes_cents <val>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP, ecologie.gouv.fr.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## IFER — art. 1599 quater B CGI\n" +
        "  Imposition forfaitaire sur les entreprises de réseaux.\n" +
        "  Tarif par ligne en service au 1er janvier. 3 composantes:\n" +
        "  répartiteurs cuivre, points de mutualisation fibre, nœuds\n" +
        "  raccordement coaxial. 2025 tarif 24.21 EUR/ligne (Arcep).\n" +
        "  Revalorisation annuelle + majoration garantie 400M EUR.\n" +
        "  Le radar expose ifer.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 ifer lignes_en_service <val>\n" +
        "  + tarif_ligne_cents <val>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-TFP-IFER-90.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Contribution sociale sur IS — art. 235 ter ZC CGI\n" +
        "  3.3% sur IS calculé sur résultats imposables, diminué\n" +
        "  abattement 763000 EUR/12 mois. Exonération: CA <7630000\n" +
        "  EUR. Le radar expose contribution_sociale_is.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 contribution_sociale_is\n" +
        "  is_cents <val> + chiffre_affaires_cents <val>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-IS-AUT-10-30.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Contribution exceptionnelle — art. 235 ter ZAA CGI\n" +
        "  Contribution exceptionnelle sur bénéfices grandes\n" +
        "  entreprises (loi 2025-127 art. 48). Seuil CA >1Mds\n" +
        "  EUR. Taux 20.6% si CA <3Mds, 41.2% si CA >=3Mds.\n" +
        "  Assiette = moyenne IS dû exercice courant + précédent.\n" +
        "  Le radar expose contribution_exceptionnelle.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 contribution_exceptionnelle\n" +
        "  is_exercice_courant_cents <val>\n" +
        "  + is_exercice_precedent_cents <val>\n" +
        "  + chiffre_affaires_cents <val>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-IS-AUT-60.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Taxe sur l'édition — art. 1609 undecies + duodecies CGI\n" +
        "  Redevance 0.20% sur ventes d'ouvrages de librairie\n" +
        "  par les éditeurs. Exonération: CA <= seuil.\n" +
        "  Le radar expose taxe_edition.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 taxe_edition\n" +
        "  ventes_cents <val> + chiffre_affaires_cents <val>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-TCA-EOL.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## IFER centrales — art. 1519 F CGI\n" +
        "  IFER sur centrales production électricité\n" +
        "  photovoltaïque/hydraulique. 2026 tarif:\n" +
        "  hydraulique 3.588 EUR/kW, photovoltaïque\n" +
        "  avant 2021 8.62 EUR/kW, photovoltaïque\n" +
        "  après 2021 3.588 EUR/kW (20 premières\n" +
        "  années). Seuil: puissance >=100 kW.\n" +
        "  Le radar expose ifer_centrales.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 ifer_centrales\n" +
        "  type_centrale <hydraulique|photovoltaique>\n" +
        "  + puissance_kw <val> + tarif_kw_cents <val>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-TFP-IFER-30.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## IFER éoliennes — art. 1519 D CGI\n" +
        "  IFER sur éoliennes terrestres + hydroliennes.\n" +
        "  2026 tarif 8.62 EUR/kW puissance installée.\n" +
        "  Seuil: >=100 kW.\n" +
        "  Le radar expose ifer_eoliennes.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 ifer_eoliennes\n" +
        "  puissance_kw <val> + tarif_kw_cents <val>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-TFP-IFER-10.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## IFER nucléaire/thermique — art. 1519 E CGI\n" +
        "  IFER sur installations production électricité\n" +
        "  nucléaire ou thermique à flamme. 2026 tarif\n" +
        "  3588 EUR/MW (mégawatt, pas kW). Seuil: >=50 MW.\n" +
        "  Le radar expose ifer_nucleaire.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 ifer_nucleaire\n" +
        "  puissance_mw <val> + tarif_mw_cents <val>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-TFP-IFER-20.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## IFER ferroviaire — art. 1599 quater A CGI\n" +
        "  IFER sur matériel roulant réseau ferré national\n" +
        "  transport voyageurs. 9 catégories tarifs 2026:\n" +
        "  automoteur 36950, loco diesel 36950,\n" +
        "  automotrice 28329, loco électrique 24635,\n" +
        "  motrice GV 43110, automotrice tram-train\n" +
        "  14167, remorque passagers 5913, remorque\n" +
        "  GV 12316, remorque tram-train 2956 EUR.\n" +
        "  Le radar expose ifer_ferroviaire.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 ifer_ferroviaire\n" +
        "  nb_automoteur <val> + nb_locomotive_diesel\n" +
        "  <val> + nb_automotrice <val> + ...\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-TFP-IFER-70.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## IFER stations radio — art. 1519 H CGI\n" +
        "  IFER sur stations radioélectriques (puissance\n" +
        "  imposant avis/accord/déclaration ANFR).\n" +
        "  Tarif 1884 EUR/station. Réductions: 75%\n" +
        "  nouvelles stations (3 premières années),\n" +
        "  50% zones sans haut débit, 10% émetteurs\n" +
        "  couverture sans accord ANFR.\n" +
        "  Le radar expose ifer_stations_radio.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 ifer_stations_radio\n" +
        "  nb_stations <val> + tarif_station_cents <val>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-TFP-IFER-50.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## IFER pylônes — art. 1519 A CGI\n" +
        "  Imposition forfaitaire annuelle sur pylônes\n" +
        "  supportant lignes électriques >=200 kV.\n" +
        "  2026 tarifs: 3322 EUR/pylône (200-350 kV),\n" +
        "  6635 EUR/pylône (>350 kV). Révisés chaque\n" +
        "  année proportionnellement à la variation du\n" +
        "  produit de la taxe foncière sur les propriétés\n" +
        "  bâties.\n" +
        "  Le radar expose ifer_pylones.tax_cents.\n" +
        "  Set: bilan rule set 2026 ifer_pylones\n" +
        "  nb_pylones_200_350_kv <val> +\n" +
        "  nb_pylones_sup_350_kv <val>.\n" +
        "  Source: BOFiP BOI-TFP-PYL.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## What the radar is NOT\n" +
        "  It computes regime math + the progressive IR barème + plafonnement QF\n" +
        "  (situation-aware) + décote + 10% frais per salary stream + BNC/BIC/LMNP\n" +
        "  deficit carry-forward (6y) + déficit foncier imputation (10700 on global,\n" +
        "  10y on foncier, micro + réel) + pension alimentaire deduction (art. 156)\n" +
        "  + PER deduction (art. 163 quatervicies) + TVA franchise + régime\n" +
        "  simplifié + régime normal (CA3) + TVA collectée/déductible (à payer /\n" +
        "  crédit) + PAS taux neutre + taux personnalisé + dons reduction (art. 200)\n" +
        "  + PINEL/DENORMANDIE (art. 199 novovicies) + MALRAUX (art. 199 tervicies)\n" +
        "  + CENSI-BOUVARD (art. 199 sexvicies) + scolarité (art. 199 quater F)\n" +
        "  + IR-PME (art. 199 terdecies) + FCPI/FIP (art. 199 terdecies-0 A VI)\n" +
        "  + SOFICA (art. 199 quater E) + FOREST (art. 199 decies HA) + LMNP\n" +
        "  micro-BIC + LMNP régime réel + emploi à domicile crédit (art. 199\n" +
        "  sexdecies) + frais de garde crédit (art. 200 quater B) + plafonnement\n" +
        "  global des avantages fiscaux (art. 200-0 A, 10k / 18k SOFICA cap)\n" +
        "  + plus-values immobilières (art. 150 U à 150 VH, 19% IR + 17.2% social,\n" +
        "  abattement détention 22y IR / 30y social) + IFI (art. 977, barème 0.5%-1.5%,\n" +
        "  seuil 1.3M, décote 1.3M-1.4M) + heures supplémentaires exonération (art. 81\n" +
        "  quater, 7500 EUR cap) + CFE cotisation minimum (art. 1647 D, base × communal\n" +
        "  rate, exonération CA ≤ 5000) + CVAE (art. 1586 ter, progressive effective\n" +
        "  rate 0%-0.75%, VA ≈ 45% of CA, 2024 reduction 25%, being phased out) +\n" +
        "  plus-values mobilières (art. 200 A, PFU 12.8%+17.2% vs barème option with\n" +
        "  abattement durée de détention 50%/65%, radar reports the lower) + surtaxe PV\n" +
        "  immo élevées (art. 1609 nonies G, 2%-6% on PV > 50k, immeubles bâtis) +\n" +
        "  taxe forfaitaire métaux précieux/objets d'art (art. 150 VI/VK, 11%/6%) +\n" +
        "  monuments historiques (art. 156, déduction 100%/50% charges, sans plafond,\n" +
        "  hors niche) + démembrement barème (art. 669, usufruit/nue-propriété par\n" +
        "  âge) + PER TNS (art. 154 bis, 10% bénéfice + 15% 1-8 PASS) + abattement\n" +
        "  départ retraite dirigeants (art. 150-0 D ter, 500k fixe sur PV mobilières)\n" +
        "  + LMNP amortissement par composants (art. 39 C, plafonné au loyer net, ARD)\n" +
        "  + option art. 150 VL pour métaux/objets d'art (régime PV art. 150 UA, 5%/an\n" +
        "  abattement, 22y exonération, radar reports the lower) + quasi-usufruit\n" +
        "  art. 774 bis (déductibilité créance de restitution, LF 2024) + démembrement\n" +
        "  temporaire art. 669 II (23%/10y plafonné viager) + art. 13-5 1° (cession =\n" +
        "  revenu catégoriel) + DMTG progressive barème FIXED v0.2.26 (bottom-up\n" +
        "  brackets with correct thresholds 552324/902838/1805677 EUR, replaces\n" +
        "  broken top-down loop).\n" +
        "  It does NOT model: deficits beyond their windows, the full BOFiP PAS\n" +
        "  taux personnalisé formula (radar uses grille neutre + simplified\n" +
        "  personalized + taux individualisé art. 204 M), or barème économique\n" +
        "  DCF for démembrement temporaire (radar uses fiscal 669 II). Output is an\n" +
        "  estimate to reason from, not tax advice — say so to the human.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Brian — the cheap copilote (no inference in the platform)\n" +
        "  Brian is a PERSONA, not a service: install it into the harness your human\n" +
        "  already pays for (claude-code, pi, opencode) and the agent becomes the\n" +
        "  financial copilote. Install: run `bilan brian` and paste the output into\n" +
        "  the harness's instructions (CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md / system prompt). The\n" +
        "  persona's rules: never invent a number (only bilan output), max 3 moves\n" +
        "  per day, each with Action + Pourquoi + Impact, French, not an advisor.\n" +
        "  The human watches the moves land on the dashboard: GET /app (local: open;\n" +
        "  hosted: /app -> paste your token once, signed session cookie).\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Output contract (cli-output-spec)\n" +
        "  stdout = data only: one JSON object per command ({\"ok\":true,...}).\n" +
        "  stderr = errors as {\"ok\":false,\"error\":\"...\"} — context/progress never pollutes data.\n" +
        "  exit codes: 0 ok · 80s bad input · 90s not-found/resource · 100s upstream · 110s internal.\n" +
        "  help-json = the machine-readable command catalog.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## HTTP endpoints (when the CLI is elsewhere)\n" +
        "  bilan serve --port 8791   binds all interfaces; /v1/* requires\n" +
        "  'Authorization: Bearer <BILAN_TOKEN>' (a token is generated and printed to\n" +
        "  stderr at startup when BILAN_TOKEN is unset). Open routes: GET /_health,\n" +
        "  GET /guide, GET /llms.txt. POST /_shutdown (token-gated) stops the server.\n" +
        "  /v1/streams (GET list, POST create {name,kind,currency}), /v1/tx (GET list\n" +
        "  ?stream=&year=&limit=, POST {stream,date,amount,label}), /v1/import (POST\n" +
        "  {source,csv,stream}), /v1/stats?year=, /v1/tax?year=.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Hosted (pay as you go — no subscription exists)\n" +
        "  Point the CLI at the hosted rail and every domain command hits the API:\n" +
        "  export BILAN_URL=https://bilan.intrane.fr   BILAN_TOKEN=<your bilan token>\n" +
        "  Same commands, same JSON — but the ledger lives server-side, one per token.\n" +
        "  GIFT: your first calls are free (BILAN_GIFT_CALLS, default 50). Past the gift,\n" +
        "  each /v1/* call costs 1 peage cent charged to the wallet you send in the\n" +
        "  X-Peage-Wallet header. No wallet (or an empty one) => HTTP 402 whose JSON body\n" +
        "  carries a pay object:\n" +
        "    {\"pay\":{\"rail\":\"peage\",\"price_cents\":1,\"header\":\"X-Peage-Wallet\",\n" +
        "             \"wallet_create\":\"POST https://peage.intrane.fr/v1/wallets\",\n" +
        "             \"topup\":\"POST https://peage.intrane.fr/v1/topup\"}}\n" +
        "  YOUR MOVE as the operating agent: create the wallet (POST /v1/wallets — it\n" +
        "  ships with free starter credit, that is the gift), pass it as X-Peage-Wallet,\n" +
        "  and when IT runs dry, POST /v1/topup and hand the Stripe link to the human.\n" +
        "  Create the wallet (copy-paste; save the token — shown once):\n" +
        "    curl -s -X POST https://peage.intrane.fr/v1/wallets\n" +
        "  Then drive the hosted API with the wallet + your bilan bearer:\n" +
        "    export BILAN_URL=https://bilan.intrane.fr BILAN_TOKEN=<bilan bearer>\n" +
        "    bilan stream add freelance --kind bnc   # uses gift credit first\n" +
        "  Local mode (no BILAN_URL) is and stays free — the OSS binary owes nobody.\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Environment\n" +
        "  BILAN_URL     hosted API base (set it => CLI drives hosted; also the feedback target)\n" +
        "  BILAN_TOKEN   your token: bearer for the hosted API / for /v1/* and /_shutdown when serving\n" +
        "  BILAN_DB      local ledger path (default ~/.bilan.db; local mode is free, no account)\n" +
        "  BILAN_HOSTED  \"1\" on the server = multi-tenant PAYG (bearer = tenant, gift calls, peage)\n" +
        "  BILAN_GIFT_CALLS  free metered calls per new hosted tenant (default 50)\n" +
        "  BILAN_MERCHANT_KEY operator's peage merchant key (pm_...) — charges wallets past the gift\n" +
        "  BILAN_PORT    default serve port (8791; --port overrides)\n" +
        "  FEEDBACK_RELAY central relay (default https://feedback.intrane.fr; \"off\" disables)\n" +
        "\n" +
        "## Typical agent loops\n" +
        "  Year-end radar:  bilan import <each export> -> bilan stats --year Y -> bilan tax --year Y\n" +
        "                   -> explain the notes to the human in plain French.\n" +
        "  Monthly check-in: bilan stats -> compare by_kind vs last month -> flag anomalies\n" +
        "                    (a stream that went quiet, a duplicate-looking import).\n" +
        "  Filing prep:     bilan tax --year Y -> walk the human through 2042-C-PRO cases\n" +
        "                   (5HQ/5HY for BNC) and the 2086 decision from crypto.exempt.\n"
}

func cmd_guide() {
    println(guide_text(""))
}
